section.text:
#### 26\. 删除有序数组中重复项
(https://leetcode.cn/problems/remove-duplicates-from-sorted-array/) 简单模拟
```cpp
00 : 07 : 52  n 1 像是刚学时候写的代码，但快
class Solution {
public:
    int removeDuplicates(vector<int>& nums) {
        int j = 0;
        for(int i = 0;i<nums.size();i++){
            if(i==0 || nums[i]!=nums[i-1]){
                nums[j++] = nums[i];
            }
        }
        return j;
    }
};
```
借助去重容器，但复杂度会达到 nlog
```cpp
class Solution {
public:
    int removeDuplicates(vector<int>& nums) {
        set<int> mapping(nums.begin(), nums.end());
        nums.assign(mapping.begin(), mapping.end());
        return mapping.size();
    }
};
```

